<!--
  RUT_PyrelandsPortedFauna.xml          UtinniPatches — new file 2026-09-19

  PYRELANDS_DONOR_PORT_4: our own re-authors of the four Pyrelands creatures
  that were still riding a donor mod's defName while already being ours in
  identity and art. Owner ruling 2026-09-19, verbatim: "The flamefang should be
  added to the biome and any donors cut, period. Let's be done with these
  lingering traces," then "port all four" when shown the options.

    GR_Boomsnake   (Vanilla Genetics Expanded)  ->  RUT_Flamefang
    AA_Razorjack   (Alpha Animals)              ->  RUT_Sytheclaw
    AA_Barbslinger (Alpha Animals)              ->  RUT_Barbslinger
    AA_FireWasp    (Alpha Animals)              ->  RUT_FireWasp

  🔑 SHAPE: RotSporeKit/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/RUT_Emberscythe.xml, this campaign's
  already-correct port of the donor GR_Mantistanis — ParentName="AnimalThingBase"
  with a manually written race block, and NOT ONE class, comp, modExtension,
  ToolCapacityDef, BodyDef, leatherDef or SoundDef from a donor mod referenced
  anywhere below. Every def this file names is Core/expansion vanilla or this
  mod's own. That is deliberate: a missing modExtension or comp type discards the
  whole def silently, and a dangling PawnKindDef key in a biome's wildAnimals
  kills GenStep_Animals and GiddyUp's startup cache on every map of that biome
  (MEASURED, PYRELANDS_ANIMALS_GENSTEP_1).

  IDENTITY carried in, not patched on. Flamefang's and sytheclaw's label and
  description below are the owner-approved text verbatim from the two identity
  patches this port retires (Patches/FlamefangIdentity.xml,
  Patches/RazorjackIdentity_Sytheclaw.xml — both DELETED in the same change,
  git is the provenance). Barbslinger and fire wasp never had an identity patch,
  so they kept the donor's label AND the donor's description, Instagram artist
  credit and all — those descriptions are rewritten here into our own modspace;
  the two LABELS are unchanged because no ruling has ever renamed them and a new
  name is the owner's to give (sytheclaw was named by owner card, 2026-09-14).

  ART: the four override mods' own generated PNGs, moved into this mod at
  Textures/Things/Pawn/Animal/Pyrelands/<Name>/<Name>_{north,east,south}.png
  (git mv, same bytes — artpipe jobs pyrelands_boomsnake_v2, pyrelands_razorjack_v3,
  pyrelands_barbslinger_v3, pyrelands_firewasp_v3). Graphic_Multi, three facings,
  west mirrors east — the same three facings the overrides shipped. The four
  BoomsnakeArtOverride/RazorjackArtOverride/BarbslingerArtOverride/
  FireWaspArtOverride mods are DELETED with this change: their only job was to win
  a same-texPath race against the donor, and nothing casts those donor defs any
  more (checked: GR_Boomsnake and AA_FireWasp declare no race/wildBiomes at all;
  every AA_Barbslinger and AA_Razorjack self-registered biome is already stripped
  by Patches/BiomeCastEvictions_WildBiomes.xml + AnimalBiomeDuplicates_Generated.xml,
  and the four remaining AA_Razorjack casts of ours are repointed to RUT_Sytheclaw
  in the same change). Dessicated-corpse art stays on vanilla textures rather than
  donor ones, same idiom RUT_Emberscythe uses.

  WHAT WAS DROPPED with the donor frameworks, all OWED rather than replaced:
    flamefang    VEF CompProperties_InitialAbility x2 (GR_DetonatePoison,
                 GR_PoisonBlast) and GeneticRim's DeathActionWorker_ToxicExplosion.
                 All three are boomalope-genome abilities; the owner cut boomalopes
                 outright (BOOMALOPE_CUT_EVERYWHERE_1) and the ruled niche here is
                 "venom-ambusher", not a bomb. The venom itself is NOT dropped — it
                 is this mod's own RUT_FlamefangBite capacity, wired straight onto
                 the bite tool below, which is what retires Patches/FlamefangVenom.xml.
    sytheclaw    VEF CompProperties_Infecter (40% infection) and Alpha Animals'
                 AA_InfectedClaws capacity -> vanilla Scratch.
    barbslinger  VEF CompProperties_InitialAbility (AA_BarbedQuills ranged volley)
                 and AA_ToxicSting -> vanilla ToxicBite on the sting, so the sting
                 stays toxic; the ranged quill volley is gone.
    fire wasp    VEF CompProperties_Floating (hover) and CompProperties_EggLayer
                 (AA_FireWaspEggFertilized/Unfertilized are donor item defs), plus
                 AA_BurningAndFeedingBite -> vanilla Bite. Its fire nature now rides
                 the stats the donor also used for it (Flammability 0,
                 ArmorRating_Heat 1, ComfyTemperatureMax 175), not a burning tool.
  If any of these is wanted back, it attaches by PatchOperation from
  src/RimUtinni/PyrelandsMechanics, the established place for comps on Pyrelands
  fauna — no def here would need to change.

  TEMPERATURE: sytheclaw's ComfyTemperatureMax (74.3) and barbslinger's
  (79.7, with Min -2) are the values Patches/AnimalTolerances_Ashkarr.xml computes
  for the donor defs from real Ash'karr tile demands (227 and 233 tiles) — baked in
  here, because that generated patch targets the donor defName and will not reach
  ours. Barbslinger's MeatAmount 875 is likewise baked in from
  src/RimUtinni/Doctrine/Patches/MegafaunaYield.xml's donor row (bodySize 2.50,
  base 350).
-->
<Defs>

  <!-- ======================================================================
       RUT_Flamefang — was GR_Boomsnake (Vanilla Genetics Expanded).
       Venom-ambusher band, Pyrelands commonality 0.50.
       Body Snake is Core's own (Defs/Bodies/Bodies_Animal_Snake.xml — Mouth and
       HeadAttackTool groups, exactly the two tool slots the donor used), so no
       ported BodyDef is needed here as it was for RSW_Anooba.
       Changed from the donor on purpose: foodType/predator. The donor was a
       VegetarianRoughAnimal non-predator because of its boomalope half; the
       owner's own description has it striking small things flushed by the fire,
       so it is a carnivorous ambush predator with a small prey ceiling.
       ====================================================================== -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_Flamefang</defName>
    <label>flamefang</label>
    <description>A serpent of the burning grass that reads a fire front the way other things read a scent trail. It beds down in the smoldering root-mat ahead of the flames and waits, coiled tight, until the heat rolls over it and drives every small thing running — then it strikes from the ash. Its bite carries a burning venom that keeps working long after the fangs are gone, a second, slower fire under the skin.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-75</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>75</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
      <Wildness>0.6</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <uiIconScale>1.1</uiIconScale>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>venom-fangs</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>RUT_FlamefangBite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>10</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.65</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Mouth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <surpriseAttack>
          <extraMeleeDamages>
            <li>
              <def>Stun</def>
              <amount>20</amount>
            </li>
          </extraMeleeDamages>
        </surpriseAttack>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>head</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>1</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.65</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>true</ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>
        <chanceFactor>0.2</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>Snake</body>
      <fleshType>Normal</fleshType>
      <predator>true</predator>
      <maxPreyBodySize>0.6</maxPreyBodySize>
      <baseBodySize>1.5</baseBodySize>
      <baseHungerRate>0.535</baseHungerRate>
      <baseHealthScale>0.75</baseHealthScale>
      <foodType>CarnivoreAnimal, OvivoreAnimal</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Lizard</leatherDef>
      <meatLabel>flamefang meat</meatLabel>
      <trainability>Intermediate</trainability>
      <intelligence>Animal</intelligence>
      <herdMigrationAllowed>false</herdMigrationAllowed>
      <lifeExpectancy>4</lifeExpectancy>
      <gestationPeriodDays>20</gestationPeriodDays>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.08</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>1</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.15</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.5</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Cobra_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Cobra_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Cobra_Call</soundCall>
          <soundAngry>Pawn_Cobra_Angry</soundAngry>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_BigBash_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_BigBash_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_BigBash_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
      <soundEating>Reptile_Eat</soundEating>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalUncommon</li>
      <li>AnimalFighter</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RUT_Flamefang</defName>
    <label>flamefang</label>
    <race>RUT_Flamefang</race>
