  <!-- ======================================================================
       RUT_Barbslinger — was AA_Barbslinger (Alpha Animals).
       Ash-grazer band by the owner's routing call, Pyrelands commonality 0.15
       (the roster's own note is explicit that "ash-grazer" is a role label and
       not a diet claim — this is an omnivore that hunts).
       Label unchanged; description rewritten out of the donor's (which carried
       an artist credit for art we no longer ship).
       Parent is AnimalThingBase + a hand-written Insectoid race block, not the
       donor's AA_AlphaBaseInsect, and body is Core's BeetleLikeWithClaw —
       MEASURED to carry HeadClaw, Mouth and HeadAttackTool, which is what the
       donor's AA_PincerAttackTool / AA_Sting / HeadAttackTool tools map onto.
       ====================================================================== -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_Barbslinger</defName>
    <label>barbslinger</label>
    <description>A shield-backed scorpion the size of a calf, plated in heat-cured chitin that the Pyrelands' burns have taught it to wear. It works the cooling ground behind a fire front, turning over the ash with its pincers for whatever cooked in place, and it will take living prey as readily as carrion if the living prey is slow. The barbed tail is not for hunting — it is what the barbslinger does to anything that stands over its find and refuses to move.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.00</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-2</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>79.7</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>500</MarketValue>
      <MeatAmount>875</MeatAmount>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.5</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.3</ArmorRating_Sharp>
